Parade, parade, parade! It's shining bright

4
00:05:07,964 --> 00:05:13,124
呼び合う声を合図に
Using our calling voices as a signal

5
00:05:14,924 --> 00:05:17,524
Parade, parade, parade!

6
00:05:18,204 --> 00:05:20,744
探しにゆく
Going to search for it

7
00:05:21,764 --> 00:05:25,124
スタートは何度だって
No matter how many times we start

8
00:05:48,346 --> 00:05:52,066
ただ 独り言を綴った
Just stringing solitary words together

9
00:05:53,146 --> 00:05:56,686
ただ 始まりたくて走った
Just running because I wanted to begin

10
00:05:57,786 --> 00:06:01,626
遠く 暗がりに灯った
Lit up far away in the darkness

11
00:06:02,686 --> 00:06:06,326
それは 眩し過ぎた名前
That was a name far too dazzling

12
00:06:07,706 --> 00:06:12,046
それは 優し過ぎる思い出
That was a memory far too gentle

13
00:06:12,886 --> 00:06:18,286
もっと 近づけと 手を伸ばした 思いがけず 結び合った
Reaching out to get closer, we unexpectedly bonded

14
00:06:18,726 --> 00:06:23,086
ほら 今 迷子は「僕等」になった
Look, now we've become lost children together

15
00:06:23,846 --> 00:06:28,566
Parade, parade, parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade! Shining bright

16
